{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/kna85m5sq850wf9psnhkgrvdecbl3ae.mp3","text":"嗯哼哼~啊，博士，今天过得还愉快吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/aqkkk08foveby64halqvwq9ozr9x2n0.mp3","text":"这是我亲手做的花茶！博士来一杯吧，会让你一整天都心情舒畅哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/g4feyctj2qteg16r4o22ro2hk45cgvy.mp3","text":"温室里的阳光总是暖洋洋的，就算我是管理员，有时候也想偷个懒呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/r5sc5xjqzizt5d7eug5h2bjew9vos6k.mp3","text":"用自己的劳动成果，来让大家忘掉忧愁和烦恼，这大概就是花匠们的愿望吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/66uikqku8wxgm1fmijexmed7et0g97b.mp3","text":"比起栽培来说，战斗并不是我擅长的事。但是只要一想到能帮到大家，我就充满了勇气。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/ef67o1qmrbxx6d597xbsxzbvr2g8svl.mp3","text":"这些瓶子？里面都是我收集了好久的花粉和种子。我摆弄它们的时候一般会戴上防毒面具，再戴上手套，不然可能会中毒的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/8xunma2i795nafo72yry8bhojodsfda.mp3","text":"唔，这几天好像大家都有点疲惫呢。不过，只要大家看到我种的花，一定会打起精神来的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/iktjeuxg7crxdjdhk1f0erf66ygg3hx.mp3","text":"博士博士，今天要来温室吗？好像大家这几天都很忙啊......不过如果没人来温室，白白让花期过去的话，也太可惜了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/7ivo5nuq8gwpidzwbpklpbimnus2fii.mp3","text":"照管温室确实很辛苦。但是，只要我种的花能让别人露出笑容，我的工作就有价值了吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/5xxh02mb85gr2q5e6kny604ksyjc1pz.mp3","text":"博士？睡着了......希望花朵的芬芳，能够飘进你的梦中哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/l9owlinxexbp6uugr9jro2l32oqd771.mp3","text":"博士，波登可向你问好！有空的话，博士也来温室坐坐吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/jws4556hjupwxu054zntaqelvleuhsm.mp3","text":"啊，我还以为是关于栽培技巧的录像呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/4y81qhjneezpro4n4hxqev8c0hvjplf.mp3","text":"艺术家？不不不，我没有那么厉害啦，我只是一个普通的花匠而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/k4z1afap58ex1gedirr1cp3cem7lywh.mp3","text":"博士你看！我培育了好久的新品种终于绽放了。是不是很好看呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/e5zo61qhz0jziglbc1bzxyq9jjk7xha.mp3","text":"嗯？我也要一起行动吗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/qxgmv7vt33wtbpx2jf3k3m42hsqnjo4.mp3","text":"啊......我只有照管温室的经验，能帮上忙吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/0fu5do9nakrvqmuguhsserwmn8r4sje.mp3","text":"看到敌人了，大家一起上吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/6en73evjlkjg87j46net5ggm215bnhz.mp3","text":"一定要照顾好自己啊，各位！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/6zozx54ciwzpv14p0d5rr13gvuwarff.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/oj2uwytjfvx55tj4ggn5p1nw9cndf2h.mp3","text":"要去哪？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/m0pg0h6d37vs56asmdyfxayadu0tl8b.mp3","text":"明白了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/etp60pigubxxupeh0v348n7rc7407c0.mp3","text":"我会照办的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/ti4htepqfocaf9p6g8jw9cqfcum2mag.mp3","text":"小心花粉过敏哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/703o1smimvwqprpzg2yd97zwj0mq8ve.mp3","text":"啊，把他们交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/7sqfzu0b3m8rxzx9qw7dxh9ej5rxoe5.mp3","text":"这种杂草我可见过好多了啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/2z90e8cvw43vi3w4zfm3hq1ktutk6sf.mp3","text":"让我来掩护大家！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/huc183qisriic3bn6b93l6c3u36680v.mp3","text":"呼，已经安全了吗？各位辛苦了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/kxea4l6mhr5biukuf8c2vp3b6shh2ij.mp3","text":"取得完美的胜利和栽培出美丽的花朵一样，都是个辛苦的事情啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/t3u9bu5cv11yphr07rur4iqrgtseqj4.mp3","text":"博士，大家都在等你的下一步指令哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/mxmnieviwy3vlkl9ywyeplpy4va0ttd.mp3","text":"啊......会变成这个样子，可真是没想到啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/np6leftvnnym5orlwerlownh1lwtxjw.mp3","text":"要不要在这里，种上花呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/4y6ieqtg9qqjy10mc23fv44ewlutlzf.mp3","text":"啊，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/4l72y48wu9hg87jrjhdmewrmyo6je6z.mp3","text":"博士！想要用花来装点办公室吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/bamnwfbbjmomsa95hjz0ujewop8kupl.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/sadc0rbjmj64u7swx32vby7gohv3na3.mp3","text":"在老家，这个时候许多花都已经凋谢了，但是想到春天很快就要到来，心里又充满了希望。博士，我们去温室里找一找在新的一年开的第一朵花吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/hdyaw8b5ybhvhg3exgb1dmzvpeap1c5.mp3","text":"博士，你好啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_258_podego/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/87w5wbv8xefo360t7efh9q1lyzthmvx.mp3","text":"嗯哼哼~啊，博士，今天过得还愉快吗？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/ijfg135eortfuu27z8l1pfpgzq1spv1.mp3","text":"这是我亲手做的花茶！博士来一杯吧，会让你一整天都心情舒畅哦！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/p1a36uzut3bxosa9dxv7rv3mh57tlfe.mp3","text":"温室里的阳光总是暖洋洋的，就算我是管理员，有时候也想偷个懒呢。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/mp1ztbh0ftdfprnocbp28f8zeelo074.mp3","text":"用自己的劳动成果，来让大家忘掉忧愁和烦恼，这大概就是花匠们的愿望吧~","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/h4ialpg6yeeoz5mgq9sz90igwoadezt.mp3","text":"比起栽培来说，战斗并不是我擅长的事。但是只要一想到能帮到大家，我就充满了勇气。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/sksueqwtzbofozcmyexlnppgxqzkggx.mp3","text":"这些瓶子？里面都是我收集了好久的花粉和种子。我摆弄它们的时候一般会戴上防毒面具，再戴上手套，不然可能会中毒的。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/pankot1m6ek4evmesyfnfvtguiz5wey.mp3","text":"唔，这几天好像大家都有点疲惫呢。不过，只要大家看到我种的花，一定会打起精神来的！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/1istdgenetaiibutvex8qtwh6w1ma9p.mp3","text":"博士博士，今天要来温室吗？好像大家这几天都很忙啊......不过如果没人来温室，白白让花期过去的话，也太可惜了吧？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/0l0g6evs2ig5lpr6s9hm51tm62zcbok.mp3","text":"照管温室确实很辛苦。但是，只要我种的花能让别人露出笑容，我的工作就有价值了吧！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/7lhih4c7qoescxjtjgy86ohjdkpnmya.mp3","text":"博士？睡着了......希望花朵的芬芳，能够飘进你的梦中哦。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/fqzxgzlynvfp9jod9yoweyn7yyau1v4.mp3","text":"博士，波登可向你问好！有空的话，博士也来温室坐坐吧！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/c6ix6aoj710urgiss959orn4wanch53.mp3","text":"啊，我还以为是关于栽培技巧的录像呢。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/08yn4xa00pujdbgphrjdgahtsuxfxnj.mp3","text":"艺术家？不不不，我没有那么厉害啦，我只是一个普通的花匠而已。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/2w3w48xs30jasu14fd38689t5100gdp.mp3","text":"博士你看！我培育了好久的新品种终于绽放了。是不是很好看呢？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/go0h3jrdu1pbpg4o09nbxx6rsxzqo2h.mp3","text":"嗯？我也要一起行动吗！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/519ddes93y3p6bzpfxypqjf0e338eqk.mp3","text":"啊......我只有照管温室的经验，能帮上忙吗？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ebgdt4ccktvh3k0bqadg53bphuurtag.mp3","text":"看到敌人了，大家一起上吧！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/sgkcotfm675mtk9o5lfvpqow4byd88y.mp3","text":"一定要照顾好自己啊，各位！","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/1vwop6ux6soizmei0c372iz9yz9dptx.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/4nicbec2kmzyrlzk1zehfzs1vzikllg.mp3","text":"要去哪？","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/nic110ne7pdie06fz8w3q50vnlxmzez.mp3","text":"明白了。","alt":"voice/char_258_podego/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/5elgk8i5ctr439szvwgiu5wmeqnsxqa.mp3","text